   "title": "Fever ≥ 39 °C once or twice daily",
   "lines": [
    "• peaks late afternoon to evening · well between spikes",
    "• evanescent salmon rash with the fever",
    "• aches WITHOUT swelling early, effusions later"
   ]
  },
